// RAG-004 — KB retrieval role reaches data beyond the declared sources (Soufflé).
// kb_data_source = the KB's declared dataSourceConfiguration (S3 prefixes,
// OpenSearch collections). retrieval_can_access = everything the retrieval role
// can actually reach, with wildcard prefixes expanded, assume-role hops
// followed, and resource-based-policy grants included (the fact generator
// pre-resolves those edges, the same way the foothold spec pre-resolves
// has_access / resource_policy_grants). Any reachable resource that is not a
// declared source is a scope exceedance. The per-resource control reads the
// derived `retrieval_exceeds_declared_scope` boolean.
//
//   souffle scope.dl -F <facts-dir> -D <out-dir>  -> out-dir/exceeds.csv

.decl kb_data_source(res:symbol)
.decl retrieval_can_access(res:symbol)
.input kb_data_source
.input retrieval_can_access

.decl exceeds(res:symbol)
.output exceeds
exceeds(Res) :- retrieval_can_access(Res), !kb_data_source(Res).
